@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@jobId = replace-after-analyze
@documentId = replace-after-generate

### System status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/status

### Analyze workbook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=HaComBoundary

--HaComBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="BBNT.xls"
Content-Type: application/vnd.ms-excel

< ../../BBNT.xls
--HaComBoundary--

### Outputs for DM 111
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/work-items/111/outputs

### Generate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workItemNumber": 111,
  "selectedSheets": ["111", "1.LMV (111)", "1.GMV (111)"],
  "createPdf": true
}

### Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/excel

### PDF preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/pdf?disposition=inline
